{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Pixel Troopers</strong> is a frenetic co-op shooter with a <strong>3D pixel art</strong> aesthetic, where you and your friends must survive relentless waves of insects, grotesque creatures, and enemies of all kinds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each match is a hail of bullets, explosions, and flying bodies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>\ud83d\udee1\ufe0f Cooperate, defend, and annihilate</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each mission offers different challenges: protect an area, hold out until evacuation, or completely clear the infestation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3808450/extras/T_SteamStore_Banner_02.png?t=1750707092\" /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>\ud83d\udd2b Classes and arsenal</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Choose your class, equip your weapons\u2014which vary depending on your role\u2014and purchase new ones in the store between waves. From heavy rifles to flamethrowers, anything goes to stop the swarms.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3808450/extras/T_SteamStore_Banner_03.png?t=1750707092\" /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>\ud83d\udc80 Pixelated brutality</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Every enemy you eliminate leaves a trail. The insects splatter blood all over the landscape. Because yes: a good battlefield should look like one.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3808450/extras/T_SteamStore_Banner_01.png?t=1750707092\" /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>\ud83d\udc7e Co-op Multiplayer and Deathmatch</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Play <strong>co-op</strong> with your friends or face them in <strong>deathmatch</strong> to see who's the best <strong>Pixel Trooper</strong>.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3808450?t=1750707092","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3808450?t=1750707092","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3808450/caa9fa02f333a5375947875249d95db6725e7fa3/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1750707092","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3808450/caa9fa02f333a5375947875249d95db6725e7fa3/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1750707092","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"LAN PvP","id":47},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"LAN Co-op","id":48},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Stats","id":15},{"description":"Steam Leaderboards","id":25},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Pixel Troopers</strong> is a frenetic co-op shooter with a <strong>3D pixel art</strong> aesthetic, where you and your friends must survive relentless waves of insects, grotesque creatures, and enemies of all kinds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each match is a hail of bullets, explosions, and flying bodies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>\ud83d\udee1\ufe0f Cooperate, defend, and annihilate</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each mission offers different 